'''Nojikubo Kofun''' (野地久保古墳) is a [[:en:Kofun|Kofun]] located in Motonuma, [[:en:Shirakawa, Fukushima|Shirakawa, Fukushima]], [[:en:Fukushima Prefecture|Fukushima Prefecture]]. Its type is a {{ill|Jōen-kahō-fun|ja|上円下方墳|1=Joenkahofun|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Jōen-kahō-fun|13=User:Immanuelle/Joenkahofun|qq=|comment=enwiki is a redirect}}, and it has been Historic site as a National [[:en:Historic site|Historic site of Japan]]} as part of the "[[:en:Shirakawa Funada-Motonuma Sites|Shirakawa Funada Motonuma Ruins]]."

== Overview ==

<div class="thumb tright">
{| class="wikitable" style="background:#ffffff;text-align:center;font-size:85%;"
|+Chief Tombs of Shirakawa Region{{Sfn|Shirakawa City designation1 Pamphlet|2011}}
