| {{ill|Shimosozuka Kofun|lt=Shimosozuka Kofun|lt=Shimosōzuka Kofun|ja|下総塚古墳|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shimosōzuka Kofun|qq=}} || [[:en:Zenpokoenfun|Zenpokoenfun]] || {{ill|Yokoana-shiki sekishitsu|ja|横穴式石室|1=Corridor-Style Stone Chamber|2=ja|3=横穴式石室|4=zh|5=橫穴式石室|6=ko|7=굴식 돌방무덤|1=Corridor-Style Stone Chamber|2=ja|3=横穴式石室|1=Corridor-Style Stone Chamber|2=ja|3=横穴式石室|4=zh|5=橫穴式石室|6=ko|7=굴식 돌방무덤|4=zh|5=橫穴式石室|6=ko|7=굴식 돌방무덤|1=Corridor-Style Stone Chamber|1=Corridor-Style Stone Chamber|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Yokoana-shiki sekishitsu|13=User:Immanuelle/Corridor-Style Stone Chamber|qq=}} || [[:en:6th century|6th century]] late
